# ---- Project data ----
# Source PDF is large (~162 pages) and re-downloadable from clinicaltrials.gov;
# keep it out of git. The download script recreates it. Keep the folder itself.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
# Extracted text is a build artifact of the pipeline; regenerate, don't commit.
data/extracted/*
!data/extracted/.gitkeep
